== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: vcomisbf16 [ENC: EVEX, MAP: MAP5, OPC: 0x2F]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: AVX512
    ISA-SET: AVX10_2_BF16_SCALAR
    ISA-EXT: AVX512EVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: E10NF
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX CPUFLAG_ACCESS ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 D5 7D 08 2F 75 40 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R     MODRM_REG    128      8      16  BFLOAT16                         xmm6
 1     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM     16      1      16  BFLOAT16  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 r13
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000080
 2   REGISTER      HIDDEN       W          NONE     64     64       1       INT                       rflags
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [    FLAGS ] ============================================================================================
    ACTIONS: [CF  : M  ] [PF  : M  ] [AF  : 0  ] [ZF  : M  ] [SF  : 0  ] [OF  : 0  ] 
       READ: 0x00000000
    WRITTEN: 0x000008D5

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 128
  BROADCAST: NONE
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: N
       MASK: k0 [DISABLED]

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vcomisbf16w 0x80(%r13), %xmm6
   RELATIVE: vcomisbf16w 0x80(%r13), %xmm6

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vcomisbf16 xmm6, word ptr ds:[r13+0x80]
   RELATIVE: vcomisbf16 xmm6, word ptr ds:[r13+0x80]

